116
00:05:06,625 --> 00:05:10,039
NoSQL databases, storing relations between

117
00:05:10,072 --> 00:05:12,604
documents is less important and not really

118
00:05:12,636 --> 00:05:15,826
focused. Instead, SQL databases are all

119
00:05:15,923 --> 00:05:19,609
