120
00:05:19,609 --> 00:05:22,431
to query, and therefore NoSQL databases are

121
00:05:22,639 --> 00:05:25,717
also extremely popular, and MongoDB happens

122
00:05:25,845 --> 00:05:28,073
to be the most popular, again,

123
00:05:28,426 --> 00:05:31,632
interpretation, you could say, of NoSQL.

124
00:05:32,017 --> 00:05:34,261
MongoDB is what we're going to use in this

125
00:05:34,261 --> 00:05:36,569
course section, and therefore you'll see in

