00:05:36,666 --> 00:05:39,198
detail how it works. But in general, under

127
00:05:39,407 --> 00:05:41,891
Deno third-party modules, you will find

128
00:05:41,956 --> 00:05:43,927
modules that help you with MongoDB,

129
00:05:44,617 --> 00:05:47,742
for example, the Mongo module. And that's

